# Binary assets — never apply line-ending or encoding conversion.
# Rationale: two agents edit this worktree; a silently mangled .docx or .png
# is unrecoverable in review. See W0.1 command list §4.
*.docx  binary
*.doc    binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.gif   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.npy   binary
*.npz   binary
*.pyc   binary

# Frozen protocol input — stored byte for byte.
# The Phase A run manifest registers the SHA-256 of this file's CRLF raw bytes
# (b63563da3adbfb8eac4694e22e618b309dd9d6f093377768bbef103eceec8a69). Any
# line-ending normalisation would change that hash and break the fingerprint the
# manuscript relies on, so git must not touch it on check-in or check-out.
data/group_folds.csv  -text
